  aciklama:
  - "Fincan taban\u0131na yak\u0131n k\u0131s\u0131mlarda, bir tanesi g\xF6ky\xFCz\xFCn\xFC
    di\u011Feri yery\xFCz\xFCn\xFC sembolize eden, \xFCst \xFCste duran ve z\u0131t
    y\xF6nleri g\xF6steren iki \xFC\xE7gen g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Bu yans\u0131malar ya\u015Fam\u0131n\u0131n
    pek \xE7ok alan\u0131nda ne kadar arada kald\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131, y\xF6n
    bulmakta ne kadar zorland\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6steriyor {{isim}}. D\xFC\u015F\xFCncem
    o'dur ki {{ay_3}} ay\u0131n\u0131n ilk g\xFCnlerinden itibaren ba\u015Fta \xF6zel
    hayat\u0131n olmak \xFCzere ya\u015Fam\u0131n\u0131 bir d\xFCzene oturtmaya ba\u015Flayaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    i\u015Faret ediyor."
